<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraq has shut the Sheeb border crossing with Iran to check security, while Iranian and Iraqi officials discuss expelling Kurdish opposition groups from the border area, a claim Iraq publicly denies. Turkish forces remain deployed in Syria and Iraq until border security is assured, and Iraqi troops have been redeployed between Kirkuk and Baghdad amid IS plans to increase attacks in fragile regions. An IRGC officer was killed in the Iran-Iraq border mountains during clashes with Kurdish opposition, and Iraq has threatened a crackdown on opponents of its weapons-control and disarmament plan. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPSXVnY3hDdkhUd05mS1J1MFR3RHdnX09veTI2UXB3a0ZlOVNPU1NDa184ZXhWMmpFMTFmYjFYb1ZORGlzb2FtZWdET2txWUtUUEZhTHc5MWp0YUY0ck1jcVlWc21RTWt0a0hHd1VfOG5fdVZLNmV2NmpVQzJWY0UwaHQ2c2NhUlZFMVpTejI4aE84OUNNUmNsLURqMVcyVEtJNEJOdGpxbWV6UGtJYU0wMnFvMWhVdDl3M2ZrWFRtdDItSTlvbGJLaGVqZ2xOUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5jX1VnYlc1WHlzWDZYRGtJWTlveEtRMmVRTklydnZKQUFRZ2xyOXpqQVo5SzhncGE4VEg5SU1jQ1ZIdkFSNU9ya3hTSkFjYmZn?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Edge Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQY044RmhDS0FUWWlqWkpfakhhSG9BUFZqR0owQ2NwdVVhYU9UU3ZlMUlYSTVOMjZaeEY2akppcGFScHZBN3RHVnVSLVg0X0lpelpsak95eFNvU2h3LTJFSHg0aUNLbGVLOTd2WkpYQ0F4elBOUlBNdy1ZZ0FHR0kyLUozTG55T0hMY2ZJX09ubUc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Majalla&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxObF9NNE50YVQ5Q2dnS3lZWUJqN0x1RktoWENEUnJiTWJzMm80WHBHSFZJZFJ0VGgtR2tFRl8tbm15WGt6enF4aTRLS1p6X1M1S0ljUjBJUlN5bVV3al9UWVdlQ3FiVXcyeHJQTnZza3kwYU